LREWHI,	.-.			/LIQUID REWARD COUNTER - HIGH-ORDER
SEEDLO,	.-.			/RANDOM SEED - LOW-ORDER
SEEDHI,	.-.			/RANDOM SEED - HIGH-ORDER
